  --alpn-policy: list<string> # [TLS listeners] The name of the Application-Layer Protocol Negotiation (ALPN) policy. You can specify one policy name. The following are the possible values: HTTP1Only HTTP2Only HTTP2Optional HTTP2Preferred None For more information, see ALPN policies (https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/network/create-tls-listener.html#alpn-policies) in the Network Load Balancers Guide.
